**Without a calculator:** keep fractions: $V_A = \dfrac{80}{7}$, and $\dfrac{80}{7} \approx 11.4$.

**Answer: about 11.43 V.**
', status = 'READY', answer_type = 'NAT', nat_min = 11.25, nat_max = 11.5, difficulty = 2, answer_status = 'OFFICIAL_KEY', content_key = 'gate2016-s1-q55', origin = 'PYQ', updated_at = now() WHERE id = qid;
